  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Innovacin Tecnolgica II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technological Innovation Program II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecer el desarrollo tecnolgico en sectores clave para el desarrollo sostenible del pas y el fortalecimiento del Sistema Nacional de Innovacin. ObE: Expandir la inversin en I+D+I en los sectores de energa sostenible, salud, agroindustria y programas sociales, as como en nuevos sectores identificados por el GOA. Objetivo Especfico: Expandir la inversin en I+D+I en los sectores de energa sostenible, salud, agroindustria y programas sociales, as como en nuevos sectores identificados por el GOA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the technological development in key sectors for sustainable national development and strengthening the National Innovation System. OBE: Expand investment in R + D + I in the areas of sustainable energy, health, agribusiness and social programs, as well as new areas identified by the GOA. Specific Objective: Expand investment in R + D + I in the areas of sustainable energy, health, agribusiness and social programs, as well as new areas identified by the GOA.</narrative>
  </description>
